    ///   the substituted input.
    /// - <c>{ action: "block", reason }</c> — skip <c>execute</c>; the model sees
    ///   <c>reason</c> as the tool's output.
    /// - <c>{ action: "substitute", output }</c> — skip <c>execute</c>; the model
    ///   sees <c>output</c> as the tool's output.
