    /// to the matching backing method with a narrowed option surface; the full
    /// unified superset lands with <c>_admitTurn</c> (step 3).
    /// <br /><br />
    /// - <c>mode: "wait"</c> (default) — blocking turn; returns TurnResult.
    /// - <c>mode: "submit"</c> — durable queued turn; returns SubmitMessagesResult.
    /// - <c>mode: "stream"</c> — RPC-style streaming; returns <c>Promise&lt;void&gt;</c>.
    /// <br /><br />
