    /// Think.continueLastTurn from there. Prefer <c>mode: "submit"</c> or
    /// Think.addMessages instead. A submitted turn runs only after the
    /// current turn ends, so Think.waitForSubmission on it from inside
    /// the turn throws rather than deadlocking. Precise nested-call detection is
    /// deferred to <c>_admitTurn</c> (step 3).
